      "name": "Favored Enemy",
      "level": 6,
      "description": "Beginning at 6th level, choose a type of favored enemy. You have advantage on Wisdom (Survival) checks to track your favored enemies, as well as on Intelligence checks to recall information about them. When you gain this feature, you also learn one language of your choice that is spoken by your favored enemies, if they speak one at all. When you deal damage to a favored enemy, you can add your proficiency bonus to the damage dealt. You choose one additional favored enemy, as well as an associated language, at 10th, 14th, and 18th level.",
