      "name": "Nature's Veil",
      "level": 10,
      "description": "This 10th-level feature replaces Hide in Plain Sight. As a bonus action, you can magically become invisible, along with any equipment you are wearing or carrying, until the start of your next turn. You can use this feature a number of times equal to your proficiency bonus, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a long rest.",
