      "level": 13,
      "description": "At 13th level, your experience traveling through difficult and unfamiliar terrain allows you to move through the world with ease. You gain a climbing speed and a swimming speed equal to your walking speed. In addition, as a bonus action, you can jump up to 30 feet to an unoccupied space you can see. This jump does not require a running start and is additional movement.",
